{"t_ms": 591578, "conversation_id": "v2llm_streaming_retrieve_s023", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Baby Crib Service\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nComplimentary baby cribs are available for infants under two years of age, subject to availability. Guests are encouraged to request a crib while making their reservation or before arrival. The hotel provides clean bedding for every crib to ensure the comfort and safety of young children.", "# corpus/ \u2014 Hotel Documents\n\n**Owner: Lakshya**\n\n## What this folder is\n\nThe hotel's documents live here: the knowledge the assistant answers from. About 60 short \ndocuments covering things like pool and gym hours, check-in and check-out rules, menus, and \npolicies.\n\n## How to fill it\n\nSee the full instructions in `retrieval/README.md` (Step 1). In short:\n- Write ~60 short documents, one topic per file, as `.txt` or `.md`.\n- Make them realistic and varied.\n- Deliberately plant a few contradictions (e.g. one doc says the pool closes at 10 PM, \n  another says 9 PM) and keep a note of which ones, for a later experiment.\n\nThe index-building script reads every file in this folder, so anything you put here becomes \npart of the searchable knowledge.\n", "Kids Play Area\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Kids Play Zone is open daily from 9:00 AM to 8:00 PM and features indoor games, educational toys, and activity stations for children between 3 and 12 years of age. Parents or guardians are responsible for supervising their children while using the facility. Outside food is not permitted inside the play area."], "scores": [0.49068132042884827, 0.7899268865585327, 0.8379960060119629], "filenames": ["18_baby_crib.txt", "README.md", "36_kids_play_area.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 78, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
